{"id": "arts-grant-director-hawaii-trip", "title": "An arts director helped a friend obtain a grant that paid for a Hawaii trip", "seconds": 65.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "478c7a61c202237a", "words": 156, "beats": [{"scene": "g", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An arts director helped a friend apply for a San Francisco grant.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.17, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "checked", "the", "application?"], "sub": "Individual Artist Commission grants"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.59, 1.19, 1.47, 1.57, 1.93, 2.36, 2.51, 2.59, 2.82, 3.38]}, {"scene": "g", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The grant required two years of city residency. The friend lived in Nevada.", "t0": 4.29, "t1": 9.69, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2 years", "label": "Continuous city residency required"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.48, 1.04, 1.41, 1.88, 2.01, 2.31, 3.75, 3.96, 4.54, 4.81, 4.91]}, {"scene": "g", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "When staff asked for proof, the director accepted an old studio lease.", "t0": 9.81, "t1": 14.3, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "mumby-order", "kicker": "Eligibility review", "text": "Commercial lease", "mark": "lease"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.72, 1.02, 1.2, 1.95, 2.1, 2.54, 3.08, 3.24, 3.58, 4.05]}, {"scene": "g", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Commissioners approved seventy-eight grants. Her friend received fifteen thousand dollars.", "t0": 14.42, "t1": 19.94, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$15,000", "label": "Grant award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.59, 1.17, 1.91, 2.94, 3.14, 3.5, 4.04, 4.55, 4.97]}, {"scene": "g", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The grant proposal described a five-minute documentary trailer featuring interviews with elders.", "t0": 20.06, "t1": 25.59, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "recommendation", "kicker": "Original grant packet", "text": "Documentary trailer", "mark": "trailer"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.92, 1.39, 1.5, 2.18, 2.78, 3.66, 4.23, 4.83, 5.02]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The other seventy-seven grantees had a lower advance rate.", "t0": 25.81, "t1": 29.07, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "77 of 78", "label": "Awards using the regular advance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.42, 1.07, 1.82, 2.0, 2.1, 2.47, 2.94]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A city voucher records fourteen thousand dollars paid on the matching grant.", "t0": 29.19, "t1": 33.7, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "arts-voucher", "kicker": "Controller voucher", "text": "14,000 dollars", "mark": "14,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.5, 1.0, 1.53, 2.21, 2.7, 3.13, 3.51, 3.62, 3.71, 4.1]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A separate check for three thousand five hundred dollars went into Mumby’s account.", "t0": 33.82, "t1": 38.45, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,500", "label": "Personal deposit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.63, 1.0, 1.18, 1.48, 1.95, 2.26, 2.57, 3.35, 3.59, 3.79, 4.16]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Investigators traced grant money to airfare, lodging and a birthday dinner in Hawaii.", "t0": 38.57, "t1": 44.46, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "mumby-order", "kicker": "Trip reimbursements", "text": "Airfare and lodging", "mark": "lodging"}, "wt": [0.0, 1.01, 1.46, 1.81, 2.1, 2.23, 3.4, 4.05, 4.28, 4.36, 4.86, 5.18, 5.3]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Mumby admitted changing records that she had given to investigators.", "t0": 44.68, "t1": 48.14, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "mumby-order", "kicker": "January interview", "text": "Altered records", "mark": "records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.83, 1.35, 1.77, 1.93, 2.06, 2.19, 2.45, 2.57]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "After resigning, she gave another investigation the same altered emails.", "t0": 48.26, "t1": 52.85, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "mumby-order", "kicker": "Second investigation", "text": "Altered emails", "mark": "emails"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 1.33, 1.52, 1.75, 2.08, 2.84, 2.99, 3.49, 3.96]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Ethics Commission assessed twenty thousand dollars across four violations.", "t0": 52.97, "t1": 57.93, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$20,000", "label": "Four administrative penalties"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.53, 0.94, 1.47, 1.99, 2.45, 3.15, 3.71, 4.04]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The grant ledger still shows a thousand dollars of unused authority.", "t0": 58.05, "t1": 61.54, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,000", "label": "Grant balance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.48, 0.88, 1.27, 1.6, 1.7, 2.08, 2.42, 2.53, 2.92]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 61.66, "t1": 64.29, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"g": "The residency check", "a": "The advance and the trip", "f": "The evidence and the outcome"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "person"}